                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yi fe wa­raga ’diyi ojio ma dria, yi ma ji yi angu awaza opinia ’dria, kini, o’du alu ma alia, ’di mba mudri drini iri omvele mba Adari ma o’du mudri drini nari’i, yi ma fu ’ba Yahudini dria dria, karile pie, ’ba mbaza pie, anzi nyiri pie, oku pie dria, kini ma o’di yi kai kai, ma ja yi ma dri ra, ’ba ma opa afa yini dria indi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
